  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\"><p><br>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Catalogue decorations</b></span></h3>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/0/00/Shop_Rewards.png/revision/latest?cb=20171021181302\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Rewards tab\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Rewards tab\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>Rewards tab</figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Catalogue decorations</b> can be won through the <a href=\"/wiki/catalogue-8567\" title=\"Catalogue\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">catalogue</a> or <a href=\"/wiki/wheel-of-fortune-2745\" title=\"Wheel of Fortune\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Wheel of Fortune</a>. Items which can also be purchased in the shop have been omitted here.\n</p><p>Catalogue decorations are unlocked at <a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">experience</a> level 15. They change as the game is updated.\n</p>\n<div class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3ABlue_Flower_Path.png\" title=\"Blue Flower Path.png (203 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/4/46/Blue_Flower_Path.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20180412163601\" title=\"Blue Flower Path.png (203 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Blue Flower Path\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Blue Flower Path.png (203 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"Blue Flower Path\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\">Blue Flower Path</div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3AFlower_Path.png\" title=\"Flower Path.png (204 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/5/53/Flower_Path.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20180412163442\" title=\"Flower Path.png (204 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Flower Path\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Flower Path.png (204 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"Flower Path\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\">Flower Path</div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3AFlower_Log_Path.png\" title=\"Flower Log Path.png (159 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/7/76/Flower_Log_Path.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20180412163457\" title=\"Flower Log Path.png (159 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Flower Log Path\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Flower Log Path.png (159 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"Flower Log Path\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\">Flower Log Path</div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3ALog_Path.png\" title=\"Log Path.png (149 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday